BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.7 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 13.2 TL (Lower Zephyr priority numbers run first. The audio thread owns feature extraction, the model, and stream recovery.) Tj T* (Control owns temporal detection and the LED. The lower-priority main thread owns telemetry, isolating internal Serial) Tj T* (waits from keyword control. A queue copies score/timestamp/sequence/generation values, never pointers into shared) Tj T* (audio or tensor buffers. A delayed control thread can lose scores without blocking the audio consumer. An overflowing) Tj T* (audio ring rejects new samples and explicitly resets detection evidence.) Tj T* ET
